109 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (This year we began the important work of refreshing our vision and mission. That process is not yet complete, but it has already shaped our planning and is helping to sharpen how and what we deliver and communicate to families, referrers and funders. As that work concludes, it will give us a clearer and more consistent foundation for everything we do.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
110 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (The funding landscape has shifted significantly, with some streams ending and new opportunities opening up. We have responded by becoming more proactive and more diverse in our approach, spanning large grants, statutory and council funding, national foundations and, increasingly, local businesses. We have also broadened our volunteer offer beyond frontline roles to include group support, administration, events and more, attracting a wider range of skills and experience to the organisation.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
111 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (Our trustee board has changed this year. I want to sincerely thank Caroline Stephens for her years of dedicated leadership as Co-Chair; she guided the organisation through some of its most demanding periods. I also want to thank Annalise Haggar, who has had to step back from her trustee responsibilities. I am delighted to welcome Helen Green and Katy Allen to the board. Katy has stepped up as Co-Chair alongside me, and both bring exactly the experience and energy we need. We continue to actively recruit for new trustees to further enhance the support and guidance they can bring to Home Start Nottingham.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
112 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (Looking ahead, our priorities are to grow and diversify our income, manage our costs carefully, and keep our focus firmly on what families in our community need most. We hold good reserves, and while that gives us an important degree of stability, we are clear that this resource is not endless. Our task is to manage those reserves carefully and build on them, so that Home Start Nottingham has the sustainable future)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
113 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E ( our families deserve. There is much still to do, but I face it with confidence in this team )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
114 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (and in what we can achieve together.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
