/E (Volunteers remain at the heart of Home-Start Nottingham. During the year, we continued to recruit and train home-visiting volunteers while also developing a wider range of opportunities through our Volunteering Development project, funded through the Pears Compassionate Communities Fund. New roles have included group support, administration, social media, fundraising and event volunteers. We have strengthened our communications, published a regular volunteer newsletter and increased our presence at community and recruitment events. Volunteer recruitment and retention remain ongoing challenges, but this work is helping us raise our profile and build a broader and more flexible volunteering offer.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
