/E (A major organisational priority has been planning for the future. We agreed on a new vision and mission statement and a five-year Strategic Plan, setting the long-term direction for Home-Start Nottingham. Staff and trustees then worked together through eight working groups to translate this strategy into priorities and actions for the coming year. We brought this work together into a new annual Business Plan. Together, these provide a clear framework for improving our services, supporting our people, increasing awareness and strengthening our financial sustainability.)
